to express my interest in joining the Cheyenne Historic Preservation
Board. As a long-time resident of Cheyenne, I have intentionally made
my home and buit a career near downtown Cheyenne. My husband and
I bought a 1929 brick house near the Capitol, and we have spent the
past 12 years renovating and improving our home which we love and
now share with our two sons. During my time working and living in
Cheyenne I've developed a deep love and appreciation for our
community and its rich built environment.
